[7.673, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[13;30H\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[H\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mFix the task CLI: --status open and --status done currently return every task. Run the existing unittest suite first\u2026 \u001b[2m\u001b[2;1H    + 51 lines (ctrl+t to expand)                                                                                       \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3;1H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[mFixed status filtering without modifying the input list. Added empty-list and input-preservation regressions.         \u001b[5;1H\u001b[K\r\n  Tests: initially 2 failures; now all 5 pass. git diff --check passes. No commit made.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Real output from python3 tasks.py tasks.json --status open:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  [open] Ship the CLI\u001b[K\r\n  [open] Test desktop handoff\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Concise diff: 2 files changed, 15 insertions, 2 deletions.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  -    # Filtering is not wired up yet.\u001b[K\r\n  -    return tasks\u001b[K\r\n  +    if status == \"all\":\u001b[K\r\n  +        return tasks\u001b[K\r\n  +    return [task for task in tasks if task[\"status\"] == status]\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  test_tasks.py adds checks for empty input under all three statuses and "]
